                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f9e98b2f-9d23-3829-b55d-85015c5a899d",
                        "entry_id": "e28b45c9-86cd-3812-bfac-425d861819e6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "женск. к чаровник"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "edcb0654-acb7-4bd1-bf12-146fac9417ae",
                                "sense_id": "f9e98b2f-9d23-3829-b55d-85015c5a899d",
                                "text": "Гармонь делала Корчагина «свойским хлопцем», не одна дорожка в комсомол начиналась для чубатых парней именно отсюда, от певучей чаровницы гармони, то страстной и будоражащей сердце в стремительном темпе марша, то ласковой и нежной в грустных переливах украинских песен."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "99b71782-fffb-4515-a8b4-06b0a07939b7",
                        "source_entry_id": "e28b45c9-86cd-3812-bfac-425d861819e6",
                        "source_sense_id": "f9e98b2f-9d23-3829-b55d-85015c5a899d",
                        "target_lang_word": "enchantress",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "enchantress",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1dd5e579-9321-3dc6-9561-f8a3dfd944a9",
                                        "entry_id": "cf9058ec-6892-3cdd-9946-31934c3aa7ec",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A woman, especially an attractive one, skilled at using magic; an alluring witch."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5324d610-cb61-42e8-bbf3-b462719456f7",
                                                "sense_id": "1dd5e579-9321-3dc6-9561-f8a3dfd944a9",
                                                "text": "Him fortuned (hard fortune ye may gheſſe)\n To come, where vile Acraſia does wonne [live],\n Acraſia a falſe enchauntereſſe,\n That many errant knightes hath fowle fordonne: […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ccf9d290-bf4f-4522-8e04-a34fd9e39cb0",
                                                "sense_id": "1dd5e579-9321-3dc6-9561-f8a3dfd944a9",
                                                "text": "The tablets upon which the events of the day were recorded refer to enchantresses, and we can conclude that they were by no means restricted to ancient beldames."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "405f5f65-840c-417f-9d3b-d157f22341d0",
                                                "sense_id": "1dd5e579-9321-3dc6-9561-f8a3dfd944a9",
                                                "text": "For even the enchantresses Circe and Medea could not, by their black arts, prevent the unfaithfulness of Odysseus and Jason."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "afcfc152-490a-3d22-9838-bdfb229e43f6",
                                        "entry_id": "cf9058ec-6892-3cdd-9946-31934c3aa7ec",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A beautiful, charming and irresistible woman."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0069e96e-4e08-484d-bef3-a0a77a2bd8c7",
                                                "sense_id": "afcfc152-490a-3d22-9838-bdfb229e43f6",
                                                "text": "She was the enchantress of men’s hearts."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "244448dc-56aa-3284-94ff-b484963cfb74",
                                        "entry_id": "cf9058ec-6892-3cdd-9946-31934c3aa7ec",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A femme fatale."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9ae8b7ff-4497-42cc-af2b-518df2ffb92b",
                                                "sense_id": "244448dc-56aa-3284-94ff-b484963cfb74",
                                                "text": "His desire for that enchantress led him to financial ruin."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "cfe6c762-2e52-4db5-b579-d7062b17fcb4",
                        "source_entry_id": "e28b45c9-86cd-3812-bfac-425d861819e6",
                        "source_sense_id": "f9e98b2f-9d23-3829-b55d-85015c5a899d",
                        "target_lang_word": "magicien",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "magicien",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "622dfbc0-6407-3133-8af0-911ab8ecddd4",
                                        "entry_id": "465dd709-4d88-39b9-b312-ba23b8d864fc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui tient de la magie."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "rare"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9836a4b6-2bee-396c-a3d0-da1395c99f39",
                                        "entry_id": "465dd709-4d88-39b9-b312-ba23b8d864fc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Dont le caractère est illusoire et relève de la poudre aux yeux."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e8c4a56e-b4a6-44de-993a-2b74e0c2a62a",
                                                "sense_id": "9836a4b6-2bee-396c-a3d0-da1395c99f39",
                                                "text": "On propageait, sous le manteau, des renseignements magiciens."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "magicien",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "efdf6d9d-c624-34a3-930f-f7f1c7b56926",
                                        "entry_id": "4a23136b-f2c5-385b-a213-81c7a24f48a2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Celui qui pratique la magie."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Fantastique",
                                            "Jeux de rôle",
                                            "Jeux de rôle d’action-aventure"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c23e54b4-9aaa-4afc-a1b9-3e2f1ea77048",
                                                "sense_id": "efdf6d9d-c624-34a3-930f-f7f1c7b56926",
                                                "text": "D’ici furent dirigés ces inquisiteurs qui allèrent brûler Vaudois, cathares, fraticelles, béguins, sorciers, envoûteurs, magiciens, flagellants, ou juifs convertis, mais soupçonnés de sortilèges."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7dc16a7f-a5e4-40d7-98ca-f5a8ffafcb2a",
                                                "sense_id": "efdf6d9d-c624-34a3-930f-f7f1c7b56926",
                                                "text": "Comme un jeune premier qui s’éveille dans le jardin d’une magicienne, je faillis soupirer : « Où suis-je ? » car mon enchanteresse demeurait immobile et je ne savais pas bien où j’étais entré."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "30cbb83a-4768-30d5-8921-6882895b7b4e",
                                        "entry_id": "4a23136b-f2c5-385b-a213-81c7a24f48a2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Illusionniste qui produit ses effets à l’aide d’accessoires truqués."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Prestidigitation"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "908ee15b-fa88-3bd9-86a4-003d9a24f8b8",
                                        "entry_id": "4a23136b-f2c5-385b-a213-81c7a24f48a2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Celui qui, dans un art ou tout autre domaine, a le talent de produire des effets d’une telle beauté qu’on est tenté de les qualifier de magiques."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5d279ece-b130-4cf3-b329-6473c53a5b62",
                                                "sense_id": "908ee15b-fa88-3bd9-86a4-003d9a24f8b8",
                                                "text": "D’un côté, il y a le polytechnicien originaire du Maroc, devenu le chouchou des milieux financiers, un magicien à qui l’on prête des milliards les yeux fermés."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9ec19fa8-aa7a-4ffc-ad61-fda607741f3e",
                                                "sense_id": "908ee15b-fa88-3bd9-86a4-003d9a24f8b8",
                                                "text": "Ce peintre, ce musicien, ce poète est un véritable magicien."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
        ],
